{80}{[She studies you for a moment, then nods.]  I suppose I could spare you a moment or two after all.  I mean, if I had known you were so civilized, I would never have spoken like that. Please allow me to tender my apologies for my rudeness.}{[She studies you for a moment, then nods.]  I suppose I could spare you a moment or two after all.  I mean, if I had known you were so civilized, I would never have spoken like that. Please allow me to tender my apologies for my rudeness.}{}{}{}{}
