{115}{Truth be told, I really don't know too much about the island. I was just a girl then, but I'll tell you what I remember. Anything in particular you want to know about?}{Truth be told, I really don't know too much about the island. I was just a girl then, but I'll tell you what I remember. Anything in particular you want to know about?}{}{}{}{}
{116}{Are there any adventures to had there?}{}{5}{}{142}{}
{117}{Is there any places of interest a tourist should see?}{}{5}{}{123}{}
