{142}{Well - most of the dangers were dealt with long ago, but a cousin of mine said something about this huge necropolis just north of Monaco that's supposed to be full of all kinds of evil creatures. If you're really desperate for something dangerous to do, you could always go find that place. }{Well - most of the dangers were dealt with long ago, but a cousin of mine said something about this huge necropolis just north of Monaco that's supposed to be full of all kinds of evil creatures. If you're really desperate for something dangerous to do, you could always go find that place. }{}{}{}{ru 2230}
